                      {
                        "__component": "blocks.text",
                        "id": 27,
                        "variant": "body",
                        "content": "I have worked with bikes for many years; what pulls me most is the mountain bike and tougher terrain. In the workshop I look after service, sales and advice — for every type of bike.",
                        "color": "foreground"
                      },
                      {
                        "__component": "blocks.text",
                        "id": 28,
                        "variant": "body",
                        "content": "If you are not sure which service you need, tell me how and how much you ride. From that it is almost always possible to say what makes sense to do now and what can wait.",
                        "color": "foreground"
                      },
